Error [E0128]: a `Int` can't be used where a `UserId` is expected
  --> tests/ui/distinct_coerce_base.jet:4:19
    |
  4 |     id: UserId :: 42
    |                   ^^
 Why: `UserId` and `Int` are different types — even though `UserId` is built on `Int`, one is never accepted in place of the other
 Fix: construct a `UserId`: `UserId(expr)`
